WEBVTT

00:15.947 --> 00:17.737
W-What is that?

00:25.157 --> 00:25.777
Katsuyu!

00:26.277 --> 00:26.907
Yes, ma'am!

00:27.577 --> 00:28.947
I shall explain everything!

00:52.907 --> 00:54.487
Are you all right, Sakura...?

00:55.117 --> 00:55.697
Yeah...

00:55.947 --> 00:57.617
The Five Kage will
be here shortly.

00:57.697 --> 00:58.277
Shikamaru!

00:59.117 --> 00:59.947
Shikamaru!

01:13.987 --> 01:14.527
Hey!

01:14.867 --> 01:17.157
Hey, he looks real bad!

01:19.907 --> 01:20.697
Lady Katsuyu!

01:20.987 --> 01:22.697
Let's begin Distance Healing
immediately!

01:23.277 --> 01:24.117
That's not possible.

01:25.407 --> 01:26.277
Why?!

01:27.407 --> 01:31.527
Even my mini fragments attached
to everyone have been drained...

01:31.737 --> 01:34.117
They have lost their chakra
and died.

01:35.027 --> 01:35.907
That's...

01:36.737 --> 01:37.487
In other words...

01:37.867 --> 01:40.327
Everyone is in the same state
as my fragments.

01:44.447 --> 01:47.197
<i>Sorry, Dad...</i>

01:47.947 --> 01:51.367
<i>Looks like I'll be right</i>
<i>on your heels...</i>

01:51.697 --> 01:52.577
Shikamaru!

01:53.617 --> 01:55.657
<i>Sorry... Mom...</i>

01:56.367 --> 01:56.947
Shikamaru!

01:57.027 --> 01:57.777
Sakura!

02:00.527 --> 02:01.907
<i>If we're going to die anyway,</i>

02:02.867 --> 02:07.277
<i>we might as well go down fighting</i>
<i>to the best of our abilities!</i>

02:07.867 --> 02:09.947
But... at this rate...

02:18.737 --> 02:20.737
... we'll all die before
we even get to fight!

