03:52.417 --> 03:57.677
A Shinobi's Dream

04:02.467 --> 04:04.007
Shinobi are done for.

04:05.137 --> 04:06.597
There's no need to keep going.

04:08.257 --> 04:10.467
If you don't resist, I won't kill you.

04:19.007 --> 04:21.507
<i>If you keep opposing us,</i>

04:21.597 --> 04:25.217
<i>you'll continue to lose</i>
<i>your comrades one by one!</i>

04:25.677 --> 04:27.557
<i>This will become a world</i>

04:27.637 --> 04:29.637
<i>where no one who</i>
<i>acknowledges you will exist!</i>

04:32.717 --> 04:34.637
Unless you want to
be filled with regret,

04:34.717 --> 04:36.557
stop and do nothing
from here on out.

04:39.597 --> 04:42.927
If we don't do anything,
we'll be saved...?

04:43.347 --> 04:44.097
Yes...

04:44.597 --> 04:47.217
You don't have to fear death
or keep enduring anymore.

04:47.387 --> 04:48.967
You'll be entering a dream.

04:57.807 --> 04:59.007
Do not give up!

05:00.097 --> 05:03.057
If you succumb to a genjutsu,
you're no different from being dead!

05:07.387 --> 05:11.217
This giant tree is closely
connected to Obito...

05:11.507 --> 05:14.097
They're like limbs
that suck out chakra.

05:14.177 --> 05:16.387
We can't approach carelessly.

05:16.637 --> 05:18.557
Such words of weakness.

05:19.387 --> 05:20.967
So very unlike you.

05:22.597 --> 05:24.347
Sarutobi Sensei...

05:25.057 --> 05:26.137
Orochimaru...

05:26.807 --> 05:28.597
You're late...

05:28.677 --> 05:30.387
What of the Five Kage?

05:30.717 --> 05:32.507
I had them healed.

05:32.807 --> 05:36.057
So as long as they don't chicken out,
they should be coming.

05:37.257 --> 05:39.637
As sarcastic as ever, I see.

05:41.557 --> 05:43.637
Sorry I'm late, Jugo! Sasuke!

05:44.507 --> 05:45.387
You're here...

05:51.097 --> 05:54.887
This tree is huge
now that I see it up close.

05:55.347 --> 05:58.637
I wonder how long
it'll take to cut down?

05:58.717 --> 06:00.967
Who cares about that?!

06:01.217 --> 06:02.637
What's important right now...

06:03.217 --> 06:08.057
<i>... is to go over to Sasuke and</i>
<i>hug and lick him, damn it!</i>

06:08.467 --> 06:10.257
Is to heal the Allied
Forces shinobi, right?

06:11.757 --> 06:15.597
Y-Yeah! I know
that already, damn it!

06:25.597 --> 06:27.467
<i>He seems to be in a foul mood.</i>

06:30.097 --> 06:31.137
<i>What's going on?</i>

06:32.507 --> 06:36.807
<i>When that bud blooms,</i>
<i>Infinite Tsukuyomi will be complete.</i>

06:36.887 --> 06:38.347
<i>That's what Madara said.</i>

06:38.557 --> 06:42.507
<i>And yet, after depleting</i>
<i>the chakra of this many shinobi...</i>

06:42.887 --> 06:44.927
<i>the bud shows no signs of blooming.</i>

06:51.007 --> 06:52.887
So when is it going to bloom?

06:55.677 --> 06:59.007
The Eight and Nine Tails still live.

06:59.307 --> 07:00.257
Do you get it?

07:02.967 --> 07:07.597
<i>So the chakra of the Eight</i>
<i>and Nine Tails is essential</i>

07:07.677 --> 07:10.467
<i>to complete the jutsu...</i>

07:15.637 --> 07:19.097
However, if it contains even a small
amount of each of their chakra,

07:19.177 --> 07:20.257
it's fine.

07:21.347 --> 07:25.057
In other words,
it's not like it can't bloom.

07:27.177 --> 07:28.177
All that is affected....

07:28.257 --> 07:30.307
is how long it will take
to bloom.

07:30.847 --> 07:33.807
There's about 15 minutes to go.

07:34.757 --> 07:37.387
In that time, I shall stop Obito
and switch places with him.

07:37.677 --> 07:40.887
Using your Sage Power.

07:43.757 --> 07:44.887
<i>This is bad.</i>

07:45.557 --> 07:49.927
<i>Everything my original just heard</i>
<i>must be relayed to the Allied Force.</i>

07:51.847 --> 07:54.057
Anyone here belong to
the Yamanaka Clan?!

07:55.257 --> 07:55.807
Here!

07:56.307 --> 07:58.137
Can you do
the Mind Transmission Jutsu?!

07:58.507 --> 07:59.967
Yes, I can, sir!

08:00.427 --> 08:02.677
Good! Please link me
to everyone here!

08:03.557 --> 08:05.597
There are things I'd like to explain
about that giant tree,

08:05.677 --> 08:07.217
and the Infinite Tsukuyomi!

08:11.637 --> 08:12.427
<i>This sensation...</i>

08:15.557 --> 08:16.427
<i>Grandfather!</i>

08:17.137 --> 08:18.507
<i>Ah! Is that you, Tsuna?</i>

08:19.637 --> 08:23.057
<i>This voice is unmistakably</i>
<i>Lord Hashirama's!</i>

08:24.807 --> 08:27.177
<i>This means the Five Kage</i>
<i>are close enough</i>

08:27.257 --> 08:29.717
<i>to be within range of my jutsu!</i>

08:30.677 --> 08:33.507
<i>Oops! We'll have to</i>
<i>reminisce later!</i>

08:33.637 --> 08:37.307
<i>I have things I must relay</i>
<i>to you five and everyone else!</i>

08:37.967 --> 08:39.427
<i>Listen to me carefully!</i>

08:43.757 --> 08:46.507
<i>I'll retrieve a little more chakra.</i>

08:47.177 --> 08:49.557
<i>It's taking too long for it to bloom.</i>

08:51.507 --> 08:55.007
<i>So we're just nourishment</i>
<i>for that tree?</i>

08:56.427 --> 08:58.807
<i>That's what shinobi are?!</i>

08:59.557 --> 09:01.597
<i>Then... how are we supposed to fight it?</i>

09:01.637 --> 09:05.177
<i>If there's only 15 minutes left,</i>
<i>it's crazy!</i>

09:05.557 --> 09:07.007
<i>We can't even get close to it!</i>

09:08.307 --> 09:10.887
<i>And yet, doing nothing will</i>
<i>yield the same result.</i>

09:11.967 --> 09:14.217
<i>We must either cut down that tree or</i>

09:14.307 --> 09:15.887
<i>defeat the caster within</i>
<i>the remaining time.</i>

09:16.807 --> 09:17.717
<i>But...</i>

09:19.137 --> 09:21.387
I told you not to give up hope!

09:40.257 --> 09:41.307
That's what you say...

09:41.427 --> 09:43.597
But you're a reanimated person
from the past!

09:43.807 --> 09:45.967
Brought back to life!

09:46.347 --> 09:47.757
We're still alive!

09:53.177 --> 09:54.307
<i>It's all... over...</i>

09:55.007 --> 09:56.177
<i>If it's going to end like this,</i>

09:56.257 --> 09:57.637
<i>we shouldn't have gotten</i>
<i>started at all...</i>

10:02.557 --> 10:05.137
That's right. Just stay like that.

10:05.557 --> 10:08.427
I'll take you to a world where
there are no regrets.

10:25.427 --> 10:28.097
Naruto, are you done?

10:28.717 --> 10:29.597
Because I'm not.

10:37.467 --> 10:38.637
Let's go, Jugo.

10:38.847 --> 10:39.467
Yeah...

10:47.557 --> 10:48.507
<i>These are...</i>

10:48.887 --> 10:52.557
<i>I can feel them,</i>
<i>these are Naruto's feelings...</i>

10:52.847 --> 10:54.557
<i>coming through my jutsu.</i>

11:08.847 --> 11:09.757
<i>Back then...</i>

11:11.467 --> 11:14.597
<i>I knew I should've called out to him.</i>

11:15.427 --> 11:17.637
<i>I thought about it over</i>
<i>and over afterwards.</i>

11:22.507 --> 11:24.217
<i>His thoughts are flowing in.</i>

11:26.557 --> 11:27.637
<i>That's why...</i>

11:34.887 --> 11:35.557
This is...

11:42.757 --> 11:43.887
It's from that day...

12:15.467 --> 12:16.597
<i>I...</i>

12:44.257 --> 12:45.217
<i>I...</i>

12:52.217 --> 12:54.427
<i>I don't want to regret anything.</i>

12:58.467 --> 13:00.847
<i>I never want to think,</i>
<i>"I should have..."!</i>

13:01.927 --> 13:02.717
Naruto...

13:14.677 --> 13:16.597
<i>And...</i>

13:16.807 --> 13:19.347
<i>I just can't make</i>
<i>everything we've done...</i>

13:23.467 --> 13:26.137
<i>up to this point meaningless!</i>

13:29.657 --> 13:30.747
Sasuke!

13:30.747 --> 13:32.117
I'm coming too!

13:39.537 --> 13:40.787
Naruto Uzumaki...

13:41.617 --> 13:43.287
<i>Time and time again...</i>

13:56.197 --> 13:59.697
Sorry to have to borrow
more chakra.

13:59.747 --> 14:01.117
No worries!

14:02.037 --> 14:03.327
<i>Naruto, we're counting on you!</i>

14:07.537 --> 14:08.447
Hey, Sasuke...

14:08.827 --> 14:12.407
You realize that only Sage Jutsu
works on him, right?!

14:13.077 --> 14:15.697
Don't compare me to you.

14:28.157 --> 14:28.997
Look, Karin...

14:29.827 --> 14:32.157
Isn't that... Sasuke's
Curse Mark patterning?

14:32.787 --> 14:34.827
The Curse Mark is supposed
to have lost its power...

14:35.657 --> 14:39.117
Sage Power is the source
of Jugo's Curse Mark.

14:39.617 --> 14:40.907
And with Sasuke,

14:40.997 --> 14:44.747
back when I experimented with
injecting Jugo's chakra into him,

14:44.827 --> 14:47.827
he immediately unleashed
the Curse Mark.

14:48.537 --> 14:51.447
So it's not surprising
for Sasuke's Susano'o

14:51.537 --> 14:55.367
to adapt to Jugo's chakra
in similar fashion.

14:55.997 --> 14:59.657
In other words, you could call it
a Sage Jutsu Susano'o.

15:00.577 --> 15:02.037
<i>Sasuke Uchiha, huh?</i>

15:02.747 --> 15:05.287
<i>He shows the same potential</i>
<i>that Madara once did...</i>

15:05.697 --> 15:07.157
<i>You Uchiha...</i>

15:07.827 --> 15:09.617
Maybe I'll go over there too...

15:09.947 --> 15:11.327
You'll only be in the way.

15:11.407 --> 15:12.497
You'll get stabbed again.

15:12.577 --> 15:13.117
Bastard!

15:14.997 --> 15:16.827
<i>And Sasuke...</i>

15:16.997 --> 15:20.327
<i>Unlike these two in the back,</i>
<i>your power...</i>

15:20.787 --> 15:24.117
<i>Rather, unlike any of my experiments...</i>

15:24.197 --> 15:26.787
<i>your power is nothing like theirs...</i>

15:26.787 --> 15:28.697
<i>I can tell...</i>

15:29.037 --> 15:33.287
<i>From my lifelong research</i>
<i>and the data I've gathered...</i>

15:33.367 --> 15:35.537
<i>my instincts tell me...</i>

15:36.447 --> 15:40.947
<i>that you'll one day be a shinobi</i>
<i>who surpasses Madara!</i>

15:42.287 --> 15:44.197
<i>And Naruto Uzumaki...</i>

15:44.787 --> 15:46.327
<i>You remind me so much</i>
<i>of Elder Brother</i>

15:46.407 --> 15:47.287
<i>when he was young.</i>

15:48.327 --> 15:51.827
<i>He's a foolish brat who spouts idealisms</i>
<i>at the top of their voice.</i>

15:52.447 --> 15:56.537
<i>And yet, everyone likes and</i>
<i>wants to depend on you.</i>

15:58.367 --> 15:58.947
Aim!

15:59.037 --> 15:59.867
Gotcha!

15:59.947 --> 16:01.617
It'll be too late for regrets,
you know.

16:01.697 --> 16:04.407
Not that there's going to be
a future for either of you.

16:08.367 --> 16:10.997
<i>Those two really</i>
<i>went off to fight him?!</i>

16:11.077 --> 16:12.657
<i>Yeah... so then what should</i>
<i>we all do?</i>

16:13.157 --> 16:15.577
<i>We can ask...</i>
<i>when the Five Kage get here.</i>

16:15.827 --> 16:17.287
<i>Is that good enough?</i>

16:21.787 --> 16:23.867
<i>I'm looking forward to</i>
<i>the battles we'll fight...</i>

16:25.077 --> 16:27.197
<i>... up until the time I achieve</i>
<i>my true dream.</i>

16:27.697 --> 16:29.537
<i>What is your true dream?</i>

16:29.697 --> 16:32.787
<i>I thought everything we've aimed for</i>
<i>is here in this village!</i>

16:33.787 --> 16:35.497
<i>You just can't see it.</i>

16:36.497 --> 16:39.747
<i>What's even further ahead...</i>
<i>dreams of the far future.</i>

16:41.197 --> 16:43.947
<i>Then tell me about your dreams</i>
<i>of the far future.</i>

16:44.697 --> 16:47.367
These are Lord First's memories?

16:47.497 --> 16:48.657
<b>FIRE</b>

16:48.747 --> 16:50.327
<i>Dreams of the future...</i>

16:48.747 --> 16:50.327
<b>FIRE LIGHTNING</b>

16:50.577 --> 16:52.537
<b>FIRE LIGHTNING WIND</b>

16:52.617 --> 16:53.747
<b>FIRE LIGHTNING WIND EARTH</b>

16:53.827 --> 16:59.037
<b>FIRE LIGHTNING WIND EARTH WATER</b>

16:59.747 --> 17:03.247
<i>The fact that we were able</i>
<i>to convene this Five Kage Summit</i>

17:03.327 --> 17:05.617
<i>with the first Kage of each</i>
<i>of the Five Nations...</i>

17:05.617 --> 17:07.197
<i>truly fills me...</i>

17:12.827 --> 17:14.037
<i>... with gratitude!</i>

17:17.287 --> 17:18.117
<i>Elder Brother!</i>

17:18.197 --> 17:20.657
<i>You are the Hokage, representing</i>
<i>the Hidden Leaf of the Land of Fire!</i>

17:20.657 --> 17:23.657
<i>A person like you, need not bow</i>
<i>to the other Kage!</i>

17:25.287 --> 17:26.787
<i>But... I'm so happy!</i>

17:28.117 --> 17:30.697
<i>Lord Hokage, raise your head...</i>

17:31.617 --> 17:35.287
<i>That's not becoming of</i>
<i>a village leader...</i>

17:36.117 --> 17:42.367
<i>I did indeed come here to endorse</i>
<i>the gist of Lord Hokage's pact,</i>

17:42.697 --> 17:44.787
<i>but I'm not just signing</i>
<i>anything for free.</i>

17:45.787 --> 17:50.247
<i>If you behave too humbly,</i>
<i>you'll make us suspicious.</i>

17:51.327 --> 17:54.367
<i>Distributing the Tailed Beasts that</i>
<i>Lord Hokage has collected</i>

17:54.447 --> 17:55.657
<i>to the other villages</i>

17:55.747 --> 17:58.117
<i>is the condition of signing the treaty.</i>

17:58.907 --> 18:02.367
<i>This is a transaction,</i>
<i>not something to get emotional over.</i>

18:03.197 --> 18:06.747
<i>Exactly, and we'll allocate</i>
<i>the Tailed Beasts based on power,</i>

18:06.827 --> 18:08.657
<i>but you will be acquiring them</i>
<i>for a price.</i>

18:09.697 --> 18:10.577
<i>Not for free?</i>

18:10.747 --> 18:11.827
<i>Shut up!</i>

18:16.697 --> 18:18.367
This was the very first summit!

18:18.827 --> 18:23.117
Yes, and it was what would lead
to the end of minor conflicts.

18:33.947 --> 18:35.907
<i>In our village,</i>
<i>a certain temple's disciples</i>

18:35.997 --> 18:39.657
<i>have long been sealing away</i>
<i>a Tailed Beast.</i>

18:39.867 --> 18:43.407
<i>Since we already have one,</i>
<i>we do not need another.</i>

18:44.867 --> 18:47.947
<i>Instead, we would like</i>
<i>an alternative compensation</i>

18:48.037 --> 18:50.037
<i>for our collaboration in this pact.</i>

18:50.117 --> 18:51.577
<i>Would that be acceptable?</i>

18:52.697 --> 18:53.827
<i>What do you desire?</i>

18:54.537 --> 18:56.747
<i>Our nation is completely</i>
<i>covered in sand.</i>

18:57.497 --> 18:59.537
<i>Thus, we'd like the adjoining Leaf</i>

18:59.617 --> 19:02.747
<i>to share arable land with us</i>
<i>instead of a Tailed Beast.</i>

19:03.197 --> 19:05.197
<i>And the other nations to hand</i>
<i>over 30%</i>

19:05.287 --> 19:08.247
<i>of your Tailed Beast</i>
<i>purchase price as well.</i>

19:08.697 --> 19:10.247
<i>Don't mess around, Kazekage!</i>

19:10.327 --> 19:10.907
<i>What—?!</i>

19:11.447 --> 19:12.947
<i>You overstep your bounds,</i>
<i>Lord Kazekage!</i>

19:13.577 --> 19:17.997
<i>I won't sign on unless</i>
<i>all of you accept these terms!</i>

19:18.697 --> 19:21.617
<i>Mine is a desert-locked nation</i>
<i>with zero fertility!</i>

19:21.617 --> 19:25.657
<i>It's only natural to use my village's</i>
<i>Tailed Beast to full advantage</i>

19:25.657 --> 19:28.657
<i>in dealings with</i>
<i>the four other Great Nations!</i>

19:28.747 --> 19:30.697
<i>We four nations could join up...</i>

19:30.787 --> 19:33.537
<i>and defeat the Land of Wind...</i>

19:49.997 --> 19:53.617
<i>It's true that we've never</i>
<i>gotten along in the past...</i>

19:54.367 --> 19:58.787
<i>But we each did what we did</i>
<i>to protect our brethren and clans.</i>

19:59.497 --> 20:01.787
<i>There were, perhaps,</i>
<i>times when we had no other choice.</i>

20:02.907 --> 20:06.497
<i>And now, today, even if</i>
<i>our Five Nation Treaty comes to be...</i>

20:06.747 --> 20:08.867
<i>I can't say how long it will last...</i>

20:08.947 --> 20:11.747
<i>or if we can even hold to it.</i>

20:13.287 --> 20:15.697
<i>But I have this dream,</i>

20:15.787 --> 20:18.287
<i>That sometime in the future...</i>

20:18.367 --> 20:21.497
<i>There will come a day when</i>
<i>shinobi will collaborate,</i>

20:21.577 --> 20:24.497
<i>and help each other, with one heart,</i>
<i>regardless of their affiliation.</i>

20:25.747 --> 20:27.747
<i>That is my...</i>

20:27.747 --> 20:29.537
<i>My dream of the future.</i>

20:34.577 --> 20:38.287
<i>I ask you to take the first step</i>
<i>toward that dream today!</i>

20:39.077 --> 20:44.037
<i>So please, please, please, please...</i>

20:44.447 --> 20:45.617
I beg you!

20:45.697 --> 20:48.617
All of my, our beloved children!

20:49.867 --> 20:51.827
Now is the time to
take all the pain,

20:51.907 --> 20:56.197
the suffering, and frustration
we shinobi have endured...

20:56.577 --> 20:58.287
and weave it into

20:58.617 --> 21:00.537
Our true dream!

